/// M03 CORE-009 "bundled codec: roundtrip roots green".
/// Source: tests/integration/codec_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledCodec.
/// Related fixtures: compiler/testdata/current/codec/roundtrip.can
/// (ground for every root pin below: roundtrip 1, decode_integer 4,
/// via_callable 1, main 1, encode_option 1, decode_option 2 = 10
/// roots).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with passed report and exactly
/// 10 roots grounded per function in roundtrip.can (codec_test.go L68-75).
/// Encode/decode preservation facets live in
/// core-009-codec-preservation.can; the production run output/status shape
/// lives in core-009-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: roundtrip.can fixture.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and
/// C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now.
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23).
/// Case bundled/codec-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, roundtrip-roots, decode-int-roots,
/// callable-roots, main-roots, encode-opt-roots, decode-opt-roots.
/// Facet map (codec_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L68-71: exit 0, empty stderr); report-passed/root-count pin the report
/// leg (L72-75: passed true, 10 assertions); fixture-name grounds the 10
/// roots in roundtrip.can; roundtrip-roots pins roundtrip (roundtrip.can
/// L12: exact => ok receipt roundtrip); decode-int-roots pins
/// decode_integer (L23-26: exact/scaled/fractional/quoted); callable-roots
/// pins via_callable (L37: sample => ok 9007199254740993); main-roots pins
/// main (L49: [] => ok); encode-opt-roots pins encode_option (L64: 42 =>
/// ok option some JSON); decode-opt-roots pins decode_option (L75-76:
/// sample/private_name).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
